Weather condition glyphs (plan 082)
===================================

The SVG files in this directory are static-fill exports of Meteocons by
Bas Milius.

License: MIT
Upstream: https://github.com/basmilius/weather-icons

Only glyphs referenced by `src/lib/weatherArt.ts` are kept here. The static
UI reference in `prototype/weather-art.html` loads these runtime-owned files
directly instead of maintaining a duplicate asset set.
